// An indentation-delimited suite. Cols 0..16 mirror java_block 0..16. c9 methodOwnerHash is
// NEVER empty — module-level blocks are owned by the synthetic <module> method. c19 links the
// if/while condition, which is how isinstance() narrowing reaches the receiver.
// (27 columns)
.decl py_block(c0:symbol,c1:symbol,c2:symbol,c3:symbol,c4:symbol,c5:symbol,c6:symbol,c7:symbol,c8:symbol,c9:symbol,c10:symbol,c11:symbol,c12:symbol,c13:symbol,c14:symbol,c15:symbol,c16:symbol,c17:symbol,c18:symbol,c19:symbol,c20:symbol,c21:symbol,c22:symbol,c23:symbol,c24:symbol,c25:symbol,c26:symbol)
