// One row per construct the grammar could not represent. RECORDS the gap, does not repair it.
// Replaces v3's py_source_bridge_edit: tree-sitter parses 99.59% of the CPython 2.7 stdlib
// unaided, so rewriting source to recover 0.41% of files was the wrong trade. Positions stay
// measured, never mapped. Zero rows for ~99.6% of modules, Python 2 included.
// (10 columns)
.decl py_parse_gap(c0:symbol,c1:symbol,c2:symbol,c3:symbol,c4:symbol,c5:symbol,c6:symbol,c7:symbol,c8:symbol,c9:symbol)
.decl lib_py_parse_gap(c0:symbol,c1:symbol,c2:symbol,c3:symbol,c4:symbol,c5:symbol,c6:symbol,c7:symbol,c8:symbol,c9:symbol)

